              "text": "MAOIs are an absolute contraindication with 2C-B. The combination can cause hypertensive crisis or serotonin syndrome, both potentially fatal. This includes prescription MAOIs (phenelzine, tranylcypromine) and plant-based MAOIs found in Syrian rue and ayahuasca. Do not combine under any circumstances."
